spans.s:
व्यक्त (क्तः-क्ता-क्तं)
a. Made clear;
manifest; specified; enlightened.

व्यञ्जन (नं) 1.
n. A mark; beard;
privy part; sauce; food; a con-
sonant.
f. n. Double entendre;
sarcasm; significant expression.

व्यति-क्रम (मः) 1.
m. Reversed or
disappointing process or result;
disappointment; retractation;
passing over or beyond.

व्यति-क्रान्त (न्तः-न्ता-न्तं)
a. Passed over;
reversed; retracted.

व्यध् (य, औ) विध्यति 4.
a. To hit;
beat; pierce; hurt.

व्यप-दिष्ट (ष्टः-ष्टा-ष्टं)
a. Informed;
cheated; pleaded in excuse.

व्यप-देश (शः) 1.
m. Dishonesty; craft;
name; notice; hint; plea.

व्यव-छिन्न (न्नः-न्ना-न्नं)
a. Cut asunder;
different; separate.

व्यव-धान (नं) 1.
n. Idem; insertion;
intervening space or thing.

व्यव-साय (यः) 1.
m. Effort, industry;
device; practice, business.

व्यव-स्थित (तः-ता-तं)
a. Separated;
distant; extracted; fixed.

व्यव-हार (रः) 1.
m. Contest at law;
judicial procedure; steadiness;
practice; a contract; business.

व्यव-हारिक (कः-की-कं)
n. Customary;
legal; litigant; engaged.

व्या_घात (तः) 1.
m. Collision; ob-
stacle; clashing; 13th
yoga;
figure of speech;
Cassia fistula.

व्या_पन्न (न्नः-न्ना-न्नं)
a. Dead; hurt;
deranged; killed.

व्या_पारिन् (री-रिणी-रि)
a. Mover;
motive; busy; practising.

व्या_म (मः) 1.
m. A fathom; smoke;
disregard.

व्यायत (तः-ता-तं)
a. Busy; long;
hard; much.

व्या_वृत्ति (त्तिः) 2.
f. Praise; rejection;
selection. See व्यावृति.

व्या_सक्त (क्तः-क्ता-क्तं)
a. Bewildered;
attached to; detached.
